  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678abcde002, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  bookTitle: Find my Part
  bookAuthor: Andrew Freeman(2026)
  bookDescription: This is a project I'm working on myself if I can get it working
    properly I want to publish it and sell it in the app store it is a that you can
    type in your car part or the part number that you are looking for and it will
    cross reference across every single automobile that has ever been built in the
    history of automobiles to see what automobile shares that exact same part so
    you have a plethora of different automobiles that have the exact same part that
    you could pull it off of and use on your car or vice versa It's still a little
    under construction I still have to get API licensing from a couple manufacturers
    but that is the future for this project
  websiteUrl: https://superhero-project-bice.vercel.app/
  screenshots:
  - {fileID: 2800000, guid: f2f4dc737854e3b4c88b8abfe8be6aa4, type: 3}
  bookCanvas: {fileID: 717168934}
  interactRadius: 2
